{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-33","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"To find two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational but the rectangle contained by them medial.","book":10,"number":33,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.33","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.33/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":33,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","contentId":"euclid-10-33","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3b613c5a9a3551ed056cb61352d8311c3a718580e5033b332910ecb36c0efb9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-33.statement","euclid-10-33.construction.1","euclid-10-33.proof.1","euclid-10-33.proof.2","euclid-10-33.proof.3","euclid-10-33.proof.4","euclid-10-33.proof.5","euclid-10-33.proof.6","euclid-10-33.proof.7","euclid-10-33.conclusion","euclid-10-33.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-33.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7323efd527fac65c9b67ce2200ff20d9f79e906025edb25d8237f8689f147e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational but the rectangle contained by them medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"求两条平方不可公度的线段，使它们的平方和为有理面积，而以它们为边的矩形面积为中项无理量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39a4071f76564584696bfb7efa9e6f890746360dc2996c9524559a5057d761f0","citations":["euclid-10-30","euclid-6-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out two rational straight lines AB, BC commensurable in square only and such that the square on the greater AB is greater than the square on the less BC by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AB, [[X. 30](/principles/euclid-10-30)] let BC be bisected at D, let there be applied to AB a parallelogram equal to the square on either of the straight lines BD, DC and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AE, EB; [[VI. 28](/principles/euclid-6-28)] let the semicircle AFB be described on AB, let EF be drawn at right angles to AB, and let AF, FB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"请列出2,有理线段,AB,BC,平方可公度而长度不可公度,AB大号的正方形比AB小号的正方形大,在不可公度直线上比AB直线的正方形大让BC在D时被分成两部分在BD、DC和正方形直线中任一直线上,对AB a 平行四边形适用等于正方形,但有正方形个数字的缺陷并让它成为矩形 AE,EB;让AFB半圆圈在AB直角至AB时抽取EF让AF,FB连接。 [[X. 30](/principles/euclid-10-30)] [[VI. 28](/principles/euclid-6-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"639f62f9438ee18f583ad78282263bb6d744f1a30cc0304e5ea1980103c45963","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB, BC are unequal straight lines, and the square on AB is greater than the square on BC by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AB, while there has been applied to AB a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on BC, that is, to the square on half of it, and deficient by a square figure, making the rectangle AE, EB, therefore AE is incommensurable with EB. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC是不平等的直线,AB的正方形比BC的正方形比不可公度和AB直线的正方形要高,而EB和平行四边形的AB比正方形,而BC的AB和平行四边形的第四半,即其中的正方形和正方形, 两者的半数,有正方形的缺陷,使矩形,AE,EB,EB,因此AE和EB是不可公度和EB。 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffbe457a777d218aa4b599b867d8a8f691a1ba77d1e821d32ff34529e721d012","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as AE is to EB, so is the rectangle BA, AE to the rectangle AB, BE, while the rectangle BA, AE is equal to the square on AF, and the rectangle AB, BE to the square on BF; therefore the square on AF is incommensurable with the square on FB; therefore AF, FB are incommensurable in square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE至EB,矩形,BA至矩形,AB,BE,矩形,AE等于AF,矩形,BA,AE等于正方形,矩形,BE至正方形,BF,,不可公度,不可公度,FB,正方形,正方形,,正方形,,不可公度；上述对应量具有相同的比例关系。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86547502e43ef886ee4652b33c52327eb3580abdb4a104b742a44bf40d4ae8e8","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is rational, therefore the square on AB is also rational; so that the sum of the squares on AF, FB is also rational. [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是有理,AB的正方形也是有理, AF的正方形和AF,FB的正方形和有理。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1f49f165dfb743235a55402b765e3a31da4bb1c561ccbebe1ac82add4002291","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, again, the rectangle AE, EB is equal to the square on EF, and, by hypothesis, the rectangle AE, EB is also equal to the square on BD, therefore FE is equal to BD; therefore BC is double of FE, so that the rectangle AB, BC is also commensurable with the rectangle AB, EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 AE,EB等于EF,假设矩形 AE,EB也等于BD,FE等于BD,BC是FE的两倍,因此矩形 AB,BC也是可公度,矩形 AB,EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"046a151575674370fb1eac3a471f722a6220da52e8202db24ac1d892971aa501","citations":["euclid-10-21","euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, BC is medial; [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] therefore the rectangle AB, EF is also medial. [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 AB,BC是中项无理线段,因此矩形 AB,EF也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"370b7bad1fbbac15ceaa03666818bc8ae50d83d79340d7c5c2802bd7ee2902ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, EF is equal to the rectangle AF, FB; [Lemma] therefore the rectangle AF, FB is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 AB,EF等于矩形 AF,FB;因此,[引理] 矩形 AF,FB也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee9b7a76afa8fe135f3d740ae097aba3bccc8b93fb768915136f9c8f35bae9bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that the sum of the squares on these straight lines is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,这些直线上的正方形个总和是有理个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"528f27bc50b2f3b5e0948e35869f2925a461ae6035c4f2dccaaf00514749bbbf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two straight lines AF, FB incommensurable in square have been found which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，已经找到两条平方不可公度的线段 AF、FB，使它们的平方和为有理面积，而以它们为边的矩形面积为中项无理量。证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-33.source","contentId":"euclid-10-33","revisionId":"euclid-10-33@raw-f3b613c5a9a3551e","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e686c2750e257a74de414d0a1fec30fa5db8ce93254c4b118f315522400457b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","l